type: dataset
title: "IRexp, IRSpectra-Bench, and forward-verification for LLM molecular structure elucidation"
abstract: >-
  Open data and code for IRexp and IRSpectra-Bench — the manuscript
  "IRexp and IRSpectra-Bench: redistributable experimental IR band lists, a blind
  peak-list benchmark, and a recall-bound diagnosis of LLM elucidation": experimental-IR
  band lists, the blind benchmark, model predictions, and training-free forward-verification
  code.
